{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0303_1000_p", "source_sha256": "7e2c30f6efd5c75574c2cd79afaea925406e7f5098c500b892d639873b576590", "ja": "（今日はグラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の撮影だ。\nそろそろ星梨花が着替え終わるかな……？）", "zh": "（今天要拍摄写真杂志《偶像写真！！》。\n不知道星梨花差不多换好衣服了没有……？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0303_1001_022ser", "source_sha256": "04bcecd1a56467523c246f524cff0b47d98aeaa70224c12101edf102ffe5f4da", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お待たせしました。\n……ふふふっ♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生，让您久等了。\n……呵呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0303_1002_p", "source_sha256": "18365ae531fa83d133dd90c3089602b9b93a67c9b5576231fbd19cc4578b892f", "ja": "星梨花、お疲れ様。なんだか嬉しそうだな。", "zh": "星梨花，辛苦了。看起来心情很不错嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0303_1003_022ser", "source_sha256": "012aa71c15efcf8824ef5284b864ed328ffa3dd0daf71a424a48560dc51d7218", "ja": "はい！　さっき、スタイリストさんに\n髪をセットしてもらってたとき……。", "zh": "是的！刚才造型师帮我做头发的时候……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0303_1004_022ser", "source_sha256": "dcd82e38dcf4b6dc6fbdf0edf79a69016711224ad8631c9393c3f528362a2697", "ja": "小さい頃、ママにドライヤーして\nもらってたときのことを思い出したんです。", "zh": "想起了小时候，\n妈妈给我吹头发的情景。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0303_1005_022ser", "source_sha256": "f30aeaa719ece0d1eb220642e91740e5405c1ff9a976b229c362a67c4afc4186", "ja": "「髪を傷めないように、気を付けないとね」\nって……とっても優しくしてもらったんですよ。", "zh": "“要注意别伤到头发哦”……妈妈对我特别温柔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0303_1006_p", "source_sha256": "3600163aea1e559b69597120ccc915bdd1a804daf3f244066f06b11e1bd20871", "ja": "小さい頃の星梨花か……微笑ましいな。", "zh": "小时候的星梨花啊……真让人感到温馨。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0303_1007_022ser", "source_sha256": "0c91d53ce317542cdf0bf2ab03e23bd6425deadb3a91189a5c8c2aa83d2570e4", "ja": "えへへ……自分でやるのと、\nママにしてもらうのは、やっぱり違って。", "zh": "嘿嘿……自己做和让妈妈帮忙，果然还是不一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0303_1008_022ser", "source_sha256": "a928f7089876a01dec6ac1edd93f776ab08d708581b033bbbd25e31d837cebd6", "ja": "だから今でも、ママに乾かしてほしいなって\n思うことがあるんです。子どもっぽいですよね……。", "zh": "所以直到现在，我有时还是会想让妈妈帮我吹干头发。感觉自己好孩子气啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0303_1009_p", "source_sha256": "34ae1d10cf9579b0ad9fd7d5bdc4bf5298aa2daca095987c24a4bb48ce1e18a3", "ja": "そうは思わないけどな。\n星梨花はお母さんと仲良しなんだな、って思ったよ。", "zh": "我倒不这么认为。\n我只是觉得，星梨花和妈妈的关系很好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0303_1010_022ser", "source_sha256": "3a39b57eda18ce02069bfc818945569e614a4bf37290d0b210f84c4ef95340e4", "ja": "そうなんです！　わたし、家で家族と\n過ごす時間が、大好きなんですよ♪", "zh": "就是这样！我最喜欢在家和家人一起度过的时光了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0303_1011_022ser", "source_sha256": "26f66989d274cbca9edebf4018cab0f1000f57abeeb68d11552ff47e0daad3f8", "ja": "今日の撮影、なんだかお家にいる時みたいに、\nのびのびできそうな気がします。", "zh": "今天的拍摄，总觉得能像在家里一样，尽情发挥了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0303_1012_p", "source_sha256": "dd9a25b862d965026bf808065d5e4d1b03204aa7f1dfc0161ea3c7f306e81a0e", "ja": "それはよかった。\nその調子で、よろしく頼んだよ。", "zh": "那就好。保持这个状态，接下来也拜托你了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0303_1013_022ser", "source_sha256": "c1660dfa1a41527ca2f6f169054458b08a723fe15e482717d508324674132839", "ja": "はい、任せてください！　それじゃあリラックス\nできるように、寝る前の挨拶を……。", "zh": "好的，请交给我吧！那么，为了让您能够放松下来，就说几句睡前问候……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0303_1014_022ser", "source_sha256": "ee395f6724c4754a27f73ab234de76585053ffdc02f384af7a9774a2af705b3a", "ja": "おやすみなさい、{$P$}さん。\n素敵な夢が見られますように♪", "zh": "晚安，{$P$}先生。\n希望您能做个美梦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0303_1015_p", "source_sha256": "ac61f5dccbe543b8ee37899fc7bb37e957ce3dca9b95ed60697221f00f027776", "ja": "（こうして、見ているだけで眠くなるような、\n癒し系の写真が完成したのだった……フワァ……）", "zh": "（就这样，完成了光是看着就会让人犯困的治愈系照片……哈啊……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
